---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="How We Work"
  description="Four phases from workflow audit to production AI. Fixed-price pilots, defined success criteria, and risk reversal guarantee."
>

  <!-- PAGE HEADER -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <div class="text-electric-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Process</div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
          How We Work
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          Four phases that take you from workflow audit to production AI system.
          Every phase has a clear deliverable, timeline, and price. No ambiguity.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PHASES -->
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="space-y-16">

        <!-- Phase 1 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-electric-500/10 border border-electric-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-electric-400">01</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5">Weeks 1-2</div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Discovery Sprint</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
              We start by understanding your current workflows before writing a single line of code.
              This is a structured audit, not a sales call. We ask hard questions, map your
              processes, and identify exactly where automation creates the highest ROI.
            </p>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 uppercase tracking-wider">What we deliver</h3>
              {[
                'Current workflow documentation and process map',
                'Top 3 automation opportunities ranked by ROI and complexity',
                'Estimated cost savings and cycle time reduction for each',
                'Recommended pilot scope with timeline and pricing',
              ].map((item) => (
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-emerald flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  {item}
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card border-electric-500/10">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-electric-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Pricing</div>
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Free</div>
            <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-6">No commitment. No sales pitch. Just a clear picture of what AI can do for your operations.</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">How it works</div>
            <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-500">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-gray-100 rounded text-xs text-gray-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">1</span>
                30-minute intake call to understand your situation
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-gray-100 rounded text-xs text-gray-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">2</span>
                We review your current workflows and systems
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-gray-100 rounded text-xs text-gray-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">3</span>
                Deliver blueprint document within 5 business days
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-gray-100 rounded text-xs text-gray-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">4</span>
                Review together — you decide whether to proceed
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-200"></div>

        <!-- Phase 2 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-electric-500/10 border border-electric-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-electric-400">02</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5">Weeks 3-8</div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Scoped Pilot</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
              One use case. Fixed price. Defined success criteria agreed in writing before we start.
              We build a working prototype in 2 weeks, then spend the remaining time hardening,
              testing, and preparing for production handoff.
            </p>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 uppercase tracking-wider">What we deliver</h3>
              {[
                'Working prototype within 2 weeks of kickoff',
                'Integration with your existing systems (Oracle, SAP, Tally, etc.)',
                'User acceptance testing with your team',
                'Performance metrics baseline established',
                'Go/no-go criteria evaluated and documented',
              ].map((item) => (
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-emerald flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  {item}
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card border-electric-500/10">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-electric-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Pricing</div>
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Rs 3-8 Lakh</div>
            <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-1">Fixed price. Scope agreed before contract signed.</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6">Exact price depends on system complexity and integrations required.</div>

            <div class="bg-electric-500/5 border border-electric-500/10 rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
              <div class="text-electric-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Risk Reversal</div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                If the pilot does not meet agreed success criteria, we keep working until it does — at no extra cost.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Success criteria examples</div>
            <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
              <div>Invoice processing time under 5 minutes per document</div>
              <div>3-way match accuracy above 95%</div>
              <div>Zero manual data entry for standard invoices</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-200"></div>

        <!-- Phase 3 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-electric-500/10 border border-electric-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-electric-400">03</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5">Weeks 8-10</div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Production Handoff</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
              We deploy to your infrastructure, train your team, and hand over complete documentation.
              You own everything — code, workflows, credentials, documentation. No dependency on us to keep it running.
            </p>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 uppercase tracking-wider">What we deliver</h3>
              {[
                'Production deployment to your infrastructure',
                'System runbooks and operational documentation',
                'Team training sessions (hands-on, not just slides)',
                'Monitoring and alerting setup',
                'Handover of all source code and credentials',
              ].map((item) => (
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-emerald flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  {item}
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card border-electric-500/10">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-electric-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Included in pilot price</div>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Production handoff is not a separate cost. It is part of every pilot.
              We do not consider the engagement complete until your team can operate the system without us.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200">
              <div class="text-gray-900 text-sm font-medium mb-2">What "your infrastructure" means</div>
              <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-500">
                <div>Your cloud account (AWS, Azure, GCP)</div>
                <div>Your on-premise servers if required</div>
                <div>Your existing databases and ERP systems</div>
                <div>Your VPN and security perimeter</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-200"></div>

        <!-- Phase 4 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-electric-500/10 border border-electric-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-electric-400">04</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5">Month 3 onward</div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Ongoing Partnership</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Once the first system is live, we shift to a monthly retainer. This covers maintenance,
              optimization, issue resolution, and identifying the next automation opportunity.
              You get a dedicated technical partner who knows your systems deeply.
            </p>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 uppercase tracking-wider">What is included monthly</h3>
              {[
                'System monitoring and proactive issue resolution',
                'Performance optimization and fine-tuning',
                'Monthly business review with metrics report',
                'Scoping next automation opportunity',
                'Priority support for production incidents',
              ].map((item) => (
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-emerald flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  {item}
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card border-electric-500/10">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-electric-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Pricing</div>
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Rs 50K-1.5L</div>
            <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-6">Per month. Depends on number of systems and support scope.</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Why retainer, not project?</div>
            <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-500">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                </svg>
                AI systems need continuous improvement, not just one-time builds
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                </svg>
                Retainer incentivizes us to keep your systems working, not to find new problems to bill
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                </svg>
                Predictable cost for your budget planning
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICING SUMMARY -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Pricing At a Glance</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500">No hourly billing. No retainers before you see results. Clear numbers from day one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        {[
          {
            phase: 'Discovery',
            price: 'Free',
            duration: 'Weeks 1-2',
            desc: 'Workflow audit, opportunity mapping, ROI estimate, and pilot recommendation.',
          },
          {
            phase: 'Scoped Pilot',
            price: 'Rs 3-8 Lakh',
            duration: 'Weeks 3-10',
            desc: 'Fixed-price build to production with success criteria, training, and full handover.',
            featured: true,
          },
          {
            phase: 'Monthly Retainer',
            price: 'Rs 50K-1.5L',
            duration: 'Per month',
            desc: 'Maintenance, optimization, support, and next automation scoping.',
          },
        ].map((tier) => (
          <div class={`card text-center ${tier.featured ? 'border-electric-500/30 bg-gradient-to-b from-navy-700 to-navy-800' : ''}`}>
            {tier.featured && (
              <div class="text-electric-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Most Common Start</div>
            )}
            <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-2">{tier.phase}</div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">{tier.price}</div>
            <div class="text-electric-400 text-xs mb-4">{tier.duration}</div>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">{tier.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RISK REVERSAL -->
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="card border-electric-400/20 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center p-8 sm:p-12">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-electric-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-electric-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Our Guarantee
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          If the pilot does not meet agreed success criteria, we continue working
          until it does — at no extra cost.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
          Success criteria are defined and agreed in writing before the engagement starts.
          No moving goalposts. No ambiguity about what "done" means.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FINAL CTA -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-200">
    <div class="container-narrow text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        Start With the Free Blueprint
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        No commitment. No sales pitch. Just a clear picture of what AI automation can do
        for your operations — and what it would cost to get there.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/blueprint/" class="btn-primary">
          Get Free Blueprint
        </a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-secondary">
          Talk to Us First
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
